 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? For someone new to running, I' recommend a simple running shirt, a pair of comfortable running shoes, and a little bag of energy gels. Cold weather running gear depends on how cold your area is. A good warm hat and gloves make a difference. A simple running apps is nice for tracking your pace and distance. The free Strava is popular and works on phone or watch. Headlamp is handy before dawn or after sunset, and socks can make a difference on cold feet.",
